# Files carried into every worktree Claude Code creates.
#
# .gitignore syntax. Only a file that matches a pattern here *and* is gitignored
# gets copied — tracked files are never duplicated, so listing one does nothing.
# A worktree is a clean checkout: without this file the app boots without its
# environment and fails for a reason that looks like a code problem.

# Environment
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development
.env.test

# Monorepo: the same files inside each package
**/.env
**/.env.local

# Add the project's own untracked-but-needed files below. Some stacks need more:
#   Flutter   android/local.properties, ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
#   Next.js   .env.production.local
#   Terraform *.tfvars, .terraform/terraform.tfstate
# A pattern that has to reach inside a wholly ignored directory must name that
# directory (`vendor/**/config.json`), because a leading `**/` does not descend
# into one.
